@PerfCountersApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:56139

### Get IIS Applications
GET {{PerfCountersApi_HostAddress}}/api/aspnetapps/iis-apps

### Get All ASP.NET Applications

GET {{PerfCountersApi_HostAddress}}/api/aspnetapps/aspnet-apps

### Get IIS Applications from Path
GET {{PerfCountersApi_HostAddress}}/api/aspnetapps/iis-apps?path=C:\Users\Dinesh\source\repos\PerformanceMonitoring\.vs\PerformanceMonitoring\config\applicationhost.config

### Other requests...

POST {{PerfCountersApi_HostAddress}}/api/aspnetapps/performance-counters
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "AppInfo": {
        "SiteId": 1,
        "SiteName": "Default Web Site",
        "AppPoolName": "DefaultAppPool",
        "AppPath": "/async"
    },
    "Counters": [
        {
            "SelectedCategory": "ASP.NET Applications",
            "SelectedCounters": ["Requests Total", "Requests/Sec", "Requests Executing"]
        }
    ]
}

### Other requests...

POST {{PerfCountersApi_HostAddress}}/api/aspnetapps/aspnet-counters
Content-Type: application/json

[
    {
        "SelectedCategory": "ASP.NET Applications",
        "SelectedCounters": ["Requests Total", "Requests/Sec", "Requests Executing"]
    }
]

###

GET {{PerfCountersApi_HostAddress}}/api/perfcounter/categories/
Accept: application/json

### Get Application Pools
GET {{PerfCountersApi_HostAddress}}/api/perfcounter/app-pools

###

GET {{PerfCountersApi_HostAddress}}/api/perfcounter/categories/Web%20Service/instances

###

GET {{PerfCountersApi_HostAddress}}/api/perfcounter/categories/ASP.NET%20Applications/instances

### Get category instances for a specific category

GET {{PerfCountersApi_HostAddress}}/api/perfcounter/categories/W3SVC_W3WP/instances

###

GET {{PerfCountersApi_HostAddress}}/api/perfcounter/categories/.NET%20CLR%20LocksAndThreads/instances

###

GET {{PerfCountersApi_HostAddress}}/api/perfcounter/categories/.NET%20CLR%20LocksAndThreads/counters?instanceName=w3wp%231__(appa)

###

GET {{PerfCountersApi_HostAddress}}/api/perfcounter/categories/.NET%20CLR%20LocksAndThreads/counters/names

##

GET {{PerfCountersApi_HostAddress}}/api/perfcounter/categories/TCPv4/counters

###

GET {{PerfCountersApi_HostAddress}}/api/perfcounter/categories/ASP.NET%20Apps%20v4.0.30319/counters

###

GET {{PerfCountersApi_HostAddress}}/api/perfcounter/categories/ASP.NET%20Apps%20v4.0.30319/counters?instanceName=_LM_W3SVC_1_ROOT_appa

